<title>NETHERLANDS: NAGRON 1996 NET PROFIT RISES 20 PCT.</title>
<headline>NAGRON 1996 NET PROFIT RISES 20 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    15.37 vs  13.35*</p>
<p>    Net profit			    25.8  vs  21.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  6.15 vs   5.30*</p>
<p>    Turnover			     339.38 vs 359.43</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    47.33 vs  42.27</p>
<p>    Cash flow			     30.57 vs  26.53</p>
<p>* corrected for stock dividend</p>
<p>NOTE - NAGRON Nationaal Grondbezit NV said in September it</p>
<p>expected 1996 full-year net profit to rise by about 20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
